<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4629" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλοιφ-ή</span></b> , ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλείφω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>anything with which one can smear</i> or <i>anoint;</i>
			esp. <i>hog's-lard, grease,</i> either in carcase, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				9.208
			</span></i>, or when melted for use, <i><span class="en">
				17.390
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>unguent,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				6.220
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				18.179
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>paint, varnish,</i> etc., <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Criti.</u>
				116b
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.463.85
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Mi.</u>
				7.11
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νεώς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Polyaen.
					5.34
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>anointing, laying on</i> of unguents or paint, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. μύρων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Alc.</u>
					1.122c
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>erasure,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ex.</u>
				17.14
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.611a
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
